        "title": "恐怕 + proposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "恐怕 introduces a cautious, often unwelcome prediction. It need not report literal fear.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "恐怕要下雨了。",
                "pinyin": "kǒngpà yào xiàyǔ le 。",
                "meaning": "I am afraid it is going to rain.",
                "audio": "007beb5bce7e611d5ad7f28546c5983c02ab90a122168075235b045cfdc6a5af"
              },
              {
                "text": "他恐怕不会来。",
                "pinyin": "tā kǒngpà bù huì lái 。",
                "meaning": "He probably will not come.",
